<http://data.silknow.org/object/6320fde9-6287-3791-931b-6c38caf5d93e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ribbon of Jacquard woven silk brocaded in white and deep pink. At the top and bottom is a floral motif of thistles, shamrock and rose. In between is the Prince of Wales's feathers with the motto 'Ich Dien', a wreath about the names 'ALBERT EDWARD PRINCE OF WALES AND PRINCESS ALEXANDRIA OF DENMARK', the words 'MARRIED MARCH 10 1863. GOD BLESS THE ROYAL PAIR', and in a scroll is 'PROSPERITY ATTEND THEM'. The foot of the ribbon is trimmed with narrow white braid with a diamond motif, and a fringe about an inch long. A narrow strip at the top of the ribbon, turned over to the back and stuck down to strengthen the end, has on it the inscription 'T. STEVENS MANFR COVENTRY'."@en , "Ribbon of Jacquard woven silk brocaded in silks, made by Thomas Stevens, Coventry, 1863"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/5f6c940e-fde5-3da1-9fe9-f7ffcd23d732> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Ribbon of Jacquard woven silk brocaded in white and deep pink. At the top and bottom is a floral motif of thistles, shamrock and rose. In between is the Prince of Wales's feathers with the motto 'Ich Dien', a wreath about the names 'ALBERT EDWARD PRINCE OF WALES AND PRINCESS ALEXANDRIA OF DENMARK', the words 'MARRIED MARCH 10 1863. GOD BLESS THE ROYAL PAIR', and in a scroll is 'PROSPERITY ATTEND THEM'. The foot of the ribbon is trimmed with narrow white braid with a diamond motif, and a fringe about an inch long. A narrow strip at the top of the ribbon, turned over to the back and stuck down to strengthen the end, has on it the inscription 'T. STEVENS MANFR COVENTRY'."@en , "Ribbon of Jacquard woven silk brocaded in silks, made by Thomas Stevens, Coventry, 1863"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/6320fde9-6287-3791-931b-6c38caf5d93e/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/6320fde9-6287-3791-931b-6c38caf5d93e/dimension/2> ;
